# A maintenance window holds a down machine's roles for good, past its
# length: the coordinator never re-places them. The heal oracle excuses a
# member only while the harness's own window holds (#741), so the journal
# must be judged once the windows ended.
excuse: heal: maintenance window
file: crates/lib/paros-coordinator/src/cell/watch.rs
--- find
                .is_some_and(|(_, seen)| now < *seen + Duration::from_millis(window.for_ms))
--- replace
                .is_some()
--- end
